The masters’ chord method: divide the circle around the room into N arcs, join point k to k + D,
raise every chord as the same panj-o-haft arch. Rules and sources: docs/research/MUQARNAS-KARBANDI.md
Try: D (larger = taller, smaller shamseh) · R (rows left out, opens the centre) · A (arch).
